   "t": "Chef Barinov sits comfortably at the kitchen table and calmly drinks a cup of hot tea while complete chaos unfolds around him. Igor Valentinovich slowly approaches the chef, clearly annoyed by the man's relaxed behavior in the middle of a busy workday.",
